<title>RUSSIA: Russia to auction 11.5 trln rbls of T-bills April.</title>
<headline>Russia to auction 11.5 trln rbls of T-bills April.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Ministry of Finance will auction 7.5 trillion roubles of 252-day GKO discount Treasury bills (series 22080) and four trillion roubles in an additional 147-day tranche of the series 22076 bills on April 16, the Central Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
